{"unit_id":"Coco-king__dsh-x-opencode-session#card-zh","repo":"Coco-king/dsh-x-opencode-session","commit":"2e7ce82c9fa821f63edb80f2ab641a87e1a7de3c","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-x-opencode-session 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的插件，会在模型流中保留当前会话 ID，并为发往 OpenCode 网关的请求添加 x-opencode-session 请求头。它通过 llm/stream 监听器和异步会话上下文配合全局 fetch 补丁完成注入，只处理 URL 含 opencode.ai 的请求，同时保留已有请求头。插件还会在卸载时恢复 fetch，适合希望网关请求按 DSH 会话保持稳定关联的用户。无需额外密钥或插件配置，安装到 web profile 后即可使用。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:117-128","lib/index.js:168-191","cordis.patch.yml:4-6"]}
{"unit_id":"Coco-king__dsh-x-opencode-session#card-en","repo":"Coco-king/dsh-x-opencode-session","commit":"2e7ce82c9fa821f63edb80f2ab641a87e1a7de3c","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-x-opencode-session adds the current DSH session ID as x-opencode-session on model requests to opencode.ai. It carries the ID through the model stream, preserves existing headers, and restores fetch on disposal. No extra key or setting is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:117-128","lib/index.js:168-191","cordis.patch.yml:4-6"]}
